  <div class="wrap prose-layout"><div class="index-line"><span><a href="/">THE INDEX</a> / ABOUT</span><span>LISTIKA</span></div><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT / 01</p><h1>Lists with a reason.</h1><div class="prose"><p class="opening">Listika brings useful local information together in a format that is easy to scan and simple to check.</p><p>We start with Kochi. Each list collects relevant places, resources or events, with links to sources so readers can make their own decisions. Information can change, and a listing is not an endorsement or a guarantee of availability.</p><p>Read more about <a href="/editorial/">how we work</a>, or <a href="/#lists">explore the lists</a>.</p></div></div>
